
====================================================================================================
S1 -- the scalar quadratic form, constraints SOLVED by exact Schur complement
====================================================================================================
  Gauge: unitary (T=t) + 3 spatial diffeos fixing E = F_i = 0, so
     h_ij = (1+2 psi) delta_ij ,  N = Nbar(1+phi) ,  N_i = d_i B .
  phi and B carry NO time derivative anywhere => both are constraints.
  Units abar = 1, so s = sqrt(X0) = q and k is measured in units of abar.
  TADPOLE DIAGNOSTIC: F(X0) is replaced by a FREE symbol F0.  Any coefficient that
  still depends on F0 is contaminated by the non-solution background and is NOT
  quoted.  (The claims assert only the k^0 sector is contaminated -- that is TRUE
  before the Schur complement and only ASYMPTOTICALLY true after it, because the
  constraint block gets inverted.  Contamination enters relatively O(1/k^2).)

  --- X0 = s^2 = 1, k PARALLEL to a^(0) ---
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] phi and B are NON-DYNAMICAL (no omega in their 4x4 block)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] det is quadratic in omega^2 (2x2 cos/sin block)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] DOUBLE root => exactly ONE physical omega^2 branch (cos/sin degeneracy, no extra dof)   discriminant = 0
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] the LEADING large-k behaviour is tadpole-CLEAN (no F0)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] UV limit c_s^2 = (1-lam_K)/(3 lam_K-1) EXACTLY: eps-, eta_K-, F-BLIND   got -(lambda_K - 1)/(3*lambda_K - 1)
  [ok  ] 
    sign structure of the omega^4 coefficient: 16*(3*lambda_K - 1)**2*(epsilon*k**2 - 12*eta_K - 6)**2
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] eps=0 gives EXACTLY the khronometric c_s^2=(lam-1)(2-alpha)/(alpha(3lam-1)), alpha = eta_K+2/(1+s)^2   got -(2*eta_K - 3)*(lambda_K - 1)/((2*eta_K + 1)*(3*lambda_K - 1))  pred -0.5*(0.666666666666667*eta_K - 1.0)*(1.0*lambda_K - 1.0)/((1.0*eta_K + 0.5)*(1.0*lambda_K - 0.333333333333333))
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PARALLEL] ONE-LINE RESULT is EXACT: the whole eps-dependence is alpha -> alpha_eff(k) = alpha - (4/3) eps A(X0) (k/abar)^2   large-k residual = 0

  --- X0 = s^2 = 1, k PERPENDICULAR to a^(0) ---
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PERPENDICULAR] phi and B are NON-DYNAMICAL (no omega in their 4x4 block)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PERPENDICULAR] det is quadratic in omega^2 (2x2 cos/sin block)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PERPENDICULAR] DOUBLE root => exactly ONE physical omega^2 branch (cos/sin degeneracy, no extra dof)   discriminant = 0
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PERPENDICULAR] the LEADING large-k behaviour is tadpole-CLEAN (no F0)
  [ok  ] [X0=1,k PERPENDICULAR] UV limit = (1-lam_K)/(3lam_K-1) * (1 - 2 eps A(X0) X0) -- the EXACT MIRROR of G_T = 1 + 2 eps A X0.  Sign of c_s^2 unchanged.   got (epsilon - 8)*(lambda_K - 1)/(8*(3*lambda_K - 1))
       NOTE: this k-INDEPENDENT relative 2u ~ 1e-25 shift is the 'scalar mirror'
